From: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi_osal: Replace netif_rx_ni() with netif_rx()

netif_rx_ni() is no longer available in the target kernel. Deliver
the generated GARP packet through netif_rx().

Signed-off-by: chasey-dev <ellenyoung0912@gmail.com>
--- a/mt_osal_cfg80211.c
+++ b/mt_osal_cfg80211.c
@@ -3399,7 +3399,7 @@ static void mt_cfg80211_trigger_garp_for
 		MT_DEBUG_TRACE("garp create success for sta("MACSTR") connected to bss-%s\n",
 			MAC2STR(sta_mac), pNdev->name);
 		eth_type_trans(skb, skb->dev);
-		netif_rx_ni(skb);
+		netif_rx(skb);
 	} else {
 		MT_DEBUG_TRACE("garp create fail\n");
 	}
